===A3_S1_D1===
// talk to chione to start
Chione: Oh, good morning you two! #portrait:ChioneNormal
Chione: Did you sleep well? #portrait:ChioneLaugh
Noelle: Yes, we slept fine, but… #portrait:NoelleSkeptical
Narrator: You notice that Chione's holding her arms close to herself; more nervous than usual.
Noelle: Is something wrong? #portrait:NoelleSkeptical
Chione: Well… A monsteratops calf went missing last night. His parents said that he was there when they fell asleep — so everyone's on the lookout. #portrait:ChioneFrown
Amelia: Ah, they're under the Viridi's protection, aren't they? #portrait:AmeliaNeutral
Chione: It wouldn't be far off to say they're sacred in our history. As the floods happened over time, their numbers dwindled… but they've always been guardians of the forest. #portrait:ChioneHm
Chione: Stories say that they were here when Thavmia was still young. #portrait:ChioneHm
Amelia: Peaceful giants… I came across some when I was little, too. Got a scolding from ‘gran when she saw me climbing on top of them. #portrait:AmeliaHappy
Narrator: Amelia's story seems to calm Chione's mind a little.
Chione: Yes! They're very good-natured, which is why it's important we find that calf before it gets dark. #portrait:ChioneNormal
Chione: I can't imagine how stressed his parents must be… #portrait:ChioneFrown
Narrator: You get a feeling that your other plans would be postponed until this is resolved. 
Noelle: Why don’t we help you find him? #portrait:NoelleBigSmile
Chione: Are you sure? #portrait:ChioneHm
Noelle: Yeah, why not? You’ve given us a place to stay and everything. It’s the least we can do. #portrait:NoelleSmallSmile 
Chione: Alright… In that case, I’ll let the watchers know that we'll be checking out the east. #portrait:ChioneNormal
Chione: You helped clean up the path there yesterday, remember? Meet me at the forest clearing in the east. #portrait:ChioneNormal
// next, go to east forest  
